"Infernal Armor": {
  "index": 0,
  "category": "eldrin_altar",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Infernal Armor"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "The pinnacle of demonic defense, the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Infernal Armor",
          "color": "dark_red"
        },
        {
          "text": " is nearly impervious to damage.\n\nThe flames imbued into it allow me to achieve "
        },
        {
          "text": "extreme speeds while sprinting",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and if "
        },
        {
          "text": "jumping while sprinting I will launch into the air",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". "
        },
        {
          "text": "While airborne, if I crouch I will rocket myself down towards the ground, impacting in a fiery explosion",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". The farther I fall, the larger the explosion.\n\nThe armor renders me completely "
        },
        {
          "text": "immune to explosive, falling, and fire damage",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and if"
        },
        {
          "text": "I am burning, the flames empower the armor and allow me to move faster, resist knockback, and strike in melee with far more power than I would otherwise be able to",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ".\n\nIt should be noted that the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Infernal Armor performs best when enchanted",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ", as things granting step assist, higher jump, or multi-jump will greatly increase the other benefits the armor provides."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
